{"story_id":87978,"updated_at":"2026-11-20T21:44:18","headline_en":"Indian medal hopes remain as Lakshya Sen qualifies for World Tour Finals","headline_hi":"लक्ष्य सेन के विश्व टूर फ़ाइनल्स के लिए क्वालीफाई करने के साथ भारतीय पदक की उम्मीदें बरकरार हैं।","payload_en":{"story_id":87978,"headline":"Indian medal hopes remain as Lakshya Sen qualifies for World Tour Finals","counts":{"articles":2,"independent_sources":2,"outlets":2},"has_established":false,"qualified_by":"express","perspective_mode":"none","perspectives":{"–":["Hindustan Times","Times of India"]},"framing":[],"suicide":false,"thread":27875,"parents":[{"story_id":27875,"headline":"Jagsher Singh Khangurra beats Yuan-Syue Jhuang in BWF World Junior Championships quarterfinals"},{"story_id":55277,"headline":"Hylo Open: PV Sindhu and Lakshya Sen advance to tournament finals"},{"story_id":73582,"headline":"Kumamoto Masters: Lakshya Sen advances to men's singles second round"},{"story_id":77513,"headline":"Kumamoto Masters: Lakshya Sen defeats Koki Watanabe to claim maiden title"}],"children":[],"written_at":"2026-11-20T21:44:18","category":{"v":2,"primary":["india"],"secondary":["life"],"tertiary":["sport-films"]},"places":[],"people":["Rakshitha Ramraj","Kidambi Srikanth","Lakshya Sen","Hong Kong Open","Chirag Shetty","Koki Watanabe","Satwik-Chirag Shetty","BWF World Tour Finals"],"narrative":{"paragraphs":[[{"text":"On Friday, Kidambi Srikanth was defeated by Kunlavut Vitidsarn in the quarterfinals of the Hong Kong Open.","ids":[154223],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"On Friday 20 November 2026, Lakshya Sen reached the Hong Kong Open semifinals.","ids":[154226],"class":"unverified","sources":[1,2]},{"text":"Satwiksairaj Rankireddy and Chirag Shetty entered the semifinals of the tournament, reaching the men's doubles semifinals.","ids":[154241,154239],"parts":[{"text":"Satwiksairaj Rankireddy and Chirag Shetty entered the semifinals of the tournament,","ids":[154241],"class":"unverified"},{"text":"reaching the men's doubles semifinals.","ids":[154239],"class":"single"}],"class":"single","sources":[1,2]}],[{"text":"On Friday 20 November 2026, Srikanth was eliminated from the Hong Kong Open.","ids":[154228],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"Rakshitha Ramraj was eliminated from the tournament.","ids":[154229],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"Ramraj defeated Mia Blichfeldt in the opening round.","ids":[154236],"class":"unverified","sources":[1,2]},{"text":"Sen defeated Koki Watanabe in the same round.","ids":[154232],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"Srikanth beat Watanabe on Wednesday.","ids":[154245],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"Srikanth's win over Watanabe sealed Sen's spot in the season-ending event (BWF World Tour Finals) in the city.","ids":[154252],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"Satwik-Chirag Shetty won the opening game.","ids":[154267],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"They lost the second.","ids":[154268],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"They won the decider in their match.","ids":[154269],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"On Friday, Rankireddy and Shetty defeated Hu Ke Yuan and Lin Xiang Yi in the men's doubles quarterfinals.","ids":[154224],"class":"unverified","sources":[1,2]},{"text":"On Friday, Ramraj was defeated by Pornpawee Chochuwong in the women's singles quarterfinals.","ids":[154225],"class":"unverified","sources":[1,2]},{"text":"On Friday, Sen defeated Loh Kean Yew in the men's singles quarterfinals at the Hong Kong Open.","ids":[154222],"class":"partial","sources":[1,2]},{"text":"On Thursday, Sen defeated Yoo Tae Bin 12-21, 21-18, 21-14 in the quarterfinals and Rasmus Gemke 21-11, 21-18 in the pre-quarterfinals.","ids":[154231,154233],"parts":[{"text":"On Thursday, Sen defeated Yoo Tae Bin 12-21, 21-18, 21-14 in the quarterfinals","ids":[154231],"class":"single"},{"text":"and Rasmus Gemke 21-11, 21-18 in the pre-quarterfinals.","ids":[154233],"class":"partial"}],"class":"single","sources":[1,2]}],[{"text":"On Thursday, Ramraj beat Chen Yu Fei 21-18, 24-22 during the pre-quarterfinals.","ids":[154235],"class":"partial","sources":[1,2]},{"text":"On Thursday, Srikanth beat Bin.","ids":[154244],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"Ramraj experienced leg soreness and learned from the opponent's experience and consistency.","ids":[154254],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"Ramraj was consistent until the end of the game, saying, \"I think I was consistent till the very end of the game,\" and noted Fei's ability to pull the shuttle, saying, \"She was pulling all the shuttle by my side.\"","ids":[154260,154261],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"The tournament was good and Ramraj learned many things, saying, \"It has been a very good tournament. And I think I've learnt so many things from this tournament.\"","ids":[154263],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"Ramraj's next appearance would be at the Syed Modi International in Lucknow, and she intends to apply her takeaways to future competitions, stating, \"I'll carry forward everything for the upcoming tournaments. And I'll try my best.\"","ids":[154251,154270,154271],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"Kidambi Srikanth would face Kunlavut Vitidsarn later in the day.","ids":[154266],"class":"single","sources":[2]}]],"section_keys":["news","happened","happened","happened","happened","performers","performers","say","next"],"sources":[{"n":1,"url":"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/sports/badminton/lakshya-sen-satwik-chirag-storm-into-hong-kong-open-semifinals-srikanth-rakshitha-bow-out/articleshow/136035381.cms","outlet":"Times of India","title":"Lakshya, Satwik-Chirag storm into Hong Kong Open semifinals; Srikanth, Rakshitha bow out","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":2,"url":"https://www.hindustantimes.com/sports/badminton/lakshya-sen-satwik-chirag-enter-semifinals-of-hong-kong-open-101795170327892.html","outlet":"Hindustan Times","title":"Lakshya Sen, Satwik-Chirag enter semifinals of Hong Kong Open","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true}],"other_coverage":[{"text":"Lakshya Sen is the 2022 Commonwealth Games champion.","ids":[154247],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"Lakshya Sen won the Hylo Open and the Kumamoto Masters Japan.","ids":[154248],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"Satwiksairaj Rankireddy and Chirag Shetty won two Super 750 titles at the Singapore and China Opens this season.","ids":[154249],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"The 2026 season has been a breakthrough for Rakshitha Ramraj.","ids":[154250],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],"who":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Rakshitha Ramraj",null]},"timeline":[],"undated":[],"established":[],"contested":[{"text":"Satwiksairaj Rankireddy and Chirag Shetty defeated Hu Ke Yuan and Lin Xiang Yi in the men's doubles quarterfinals.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":2,"sources":[{"outlet":"Hindustan Times","url":"https://www.hindustantimes.com/sports/badminton/lakshya-sen-satwik-chirag-enter-semifinals-of-hong-kong-open-101795170327892.html","stance":"asserts"},{"outlet":"Times of India","url":"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/sports/badminton/lakshya-sen-satwik-chirag-storm-into-hong-kong-open-semifinals-srikanth-rakshitha-bow-out/articleshow/136035381.cms","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Rakshitha Ramraj was defeated by Pornpawee Chochuwong in the women's singles quarterfinals.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":2,"sources":[{"outlet":"Hindustan Times","url":"https://www.hindustantimes.com/sports/badminton/lakshya-sen-satwik-chirag-enter-semifinals-of-hong-kong-open-101795170327892.html","stance":"asserts"},{"outlet":"Times of India","url":"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/sports/badminton/lakshya-sen-satwik-chirag-storm-into-hong-kong-open-semifinals-srikanth-rakshitha-bow-out/articleshow/136035381.cms","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Lakshya Sen reached the Hong Kong Open semifinals.","verdict":"unverifi